// ---- D.2 The Stay: add as a new bullet ----
- #strong[World Turn (Module E).] If Module E is in use, a stay contains #strong[one World Turn] (E.10). The cadence with Module D is between adventures. The World Turn uses no Checks and no Stay Woe.

// ---- D.3 Upkeep: replace the Hosted row's What it provides cell ----
A host provides everything. Record an obligation (E.7): the service owed, its limits, notice, and what settles it.

// ---- D.3 Upkeep: replace the Hospitality is not free bullet ----
- #strong[Hospitality is not free.] A host creates an obligation only when the terms are agreed. A vague claim of you owe me is an unresolved negotiation (E.7).

// ---- D.4 Endeavours: Connect row, Typical Effects cell ----
Create a contact Truth; subtle cypher (A.1); Advance a faction clock only if the affected project is established (E.10)

